TI  - 323. Comparing Antidepressant Effects of Psilocybin-Assisted Psychotherapy in Individuals That Were Unmedicated at Initial Screening Versus Individuals Discontinuing Medications for Study Participation
AU  - Chisamore N
AU  - Kaczmarek E
AU  - Doyle Z
AU  - Johnson D
