TI  - Examining mystical experiences as a predictor of psilocybin-assisted psychotherapy for treatment-resistant depression.
AU  - Brudner, Ryan M.
AU  - Kaczmarek, Erica
AU  - Blainey, Marc G.
AU  - Schulz-Quach, Christian
