TI  - The Bright Side of Psychedelics: Latest Advances and Challenges in Neuropharmacology.
AU  - Mastinu, Andrea
AU  - Anyanwu, Margrate
AU  - Carone, Marinella
AU  - Abate, Giulia
AU  - Bonini, Sara Anna
AU  - Peron, Gregorio
