TI  - The therapeutic alliance between study participants and intervention facilitators is associated with acute effects and clinical outcomes in a psilocybin-assisted  therapy trial for major depressive disorder.
AU  - Levin, Adam W.
AU  - Lancelotta, Rafaelle
AU  - Sepeda, Nathan D.
