TI  - The effects of psilocybin on cognitive and emotional functions in healthy participants: Results from a phase 1, randomised, placebo-controlled trial involving simultaneous psilocybin administration and preparation
AU  - Rucker, James J.
AU  - Marwood, Lindsey
AU  - Ajantaival, Riikka-Liisa J.
