TI  - Unraveling psilocybin's therapeutic potential: behavioral and neuroplasticity insights in Wistar-Kyoto and Wistar male rat models of treatment-resistant depression
AU  - Magdalena, Kolasa
AU  - Agnieszka, Nikiforuk
AU  - Agata, Korlatowicz
AU  - Joanna, Solich
