TI  - Repeated lysergic acid diethylamide (LSD) reverses stress-induced anxiety-like behavior, cortical synaptogenesis deficits and serotonergic neurotransmission decline
AU  - De Gregorio, Danilo
AU  - Inserra, Antonio
AU  - Enns, Justine P.
